Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:07.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Silicon, the foundation of modern technology.\N硅，现代科技的基石。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.68,0:00:10.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every transistor placed with purpose.\N每个晶体管都精准布局。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.36,0:00:13.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every watt wrestled from physics.\N每瓦功率都从物理定律中挣来。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.20,0:00:18.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Where every instruction set earns its right to execute.\N每条指令集都必须证明自己值得执行。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.32,0:00:20.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is how performance gets driven.\N这就是性能的驱动力。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.59,0:00:22.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,How efficiency gets built.\N这就是效率的构建方式。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.76,0:00:26.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,How intelligence acts, not just answers.\N智能不仅回应，更主动行动。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.72,0:00:32.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our future is with ecosystems shaped by architecture.\N我们的未来在于由架构塑造的生态系统。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.44,0:00:36.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Capable of connecting technologies, tools, and partners.\N能够连接技术、工具与合作伙伴。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.56,0:00:38.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Powerful enough to execute.\N强大到足以执行。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.72,0:00:40.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Efficient enough to scale.\N高效到足以扩展。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.80,0:00:46.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Familiar enough to build with speed.\N熟悉到能快速构建。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.44,0:00:54.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, it's about the progress we scale through open platforms, shared standards, and partnerships amplifying each other's strengths.\N明天，关键在于我们通过开放平台、共享标准以及相互协作，实现规模化的进步。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.55,0:00:57.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,A unified architecture engineered for systems.\N专为系统打造的统一架构。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.55,0:01:02.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,The next chapter is being written in silicon with our engineering at its heart.\N下一个篇章正以我们的工程创新为核心，在硅基芯片上书写。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.34,0:01:03.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,Built different.\N不同地打造。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.38,0:01:04.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,Built together.\N共同打造。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.34,0:01:06.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Built on Intel.\N基于英特尔。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.88,0:01:08.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,And now, ladies and gentlemen,\N现在，女士们，先生们，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.74,0:01:12.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,please give a warm welcome to the CEO of Intel,\N让我们热烈欢迎英特尔首席执行官，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.72,0:01:23.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Lid\N陈立武。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.65,0:01:31.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Po\N立武。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.85,0:01:45.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tan.\N陈。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.52,0:01:49.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh this is the Elephant Mountain.\N噢，这是象山。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.32,0:01:53.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, 1,000 step 284 m.\N所以，1000步，284米。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.40,0:01:59.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, I survived.\N所以，我活下来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.28,0:02:01.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,And came down with one piece.\N并且完好无损地下来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.14,0:02:01.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, I'm here.\N所以，我在这里。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.96,0:02:07.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, but if I walk a little bit slower, then you know uh I'm exhausted.\N但如果我走慢一点，你就知道，我就会精疲力尽。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.04,0:02:10.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,But anyway, it's a beautiful view.\N但不管怎样，景色非常美。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.24,0:02:14.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,I mean, I highly recommend all of you to do that.\N我的意思是，我强烈推荐你们所有人去做这件事。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.12,0:02:19.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yep, I think first of all, I think uh delighted to be here.\N是的，首先，我很高兴能来到这里。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.24,0:02:21.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,And uh this is a important event.\N而且这是一个重要的活动。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.00,0:02:25.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,And then I'd like to get started.\N然后我想开始。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.00,0:02:37.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,And about nearly six decades ago a group of brilliant and highly motivated engineers and\N大约六十年前，一群才华横溢且极具动力的工程师和
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.28,0:02:46.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,venture capitalists uh including Arthur Rock Don Valentine and many others they found companies like Intel,\N风险投资家，包括亚瑟·洛克、唐·瓦伦蒂和许多其他人，他们创办了英特尔等公司。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.17,0:02:47.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Apple, and others.\N苹果公司，以及其他公司。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.92,0:02:54.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Broadly set the motion the largest economic known to mankind.\N广泛地推动了人类已知的最大经济运动。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.28,0:02:59.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh create what became known as Silicon Valley.\N嗯，创造了后来被称为硅谷的地方。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.40,0:03:03.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,And uh this is a very exciting time.\N而且现在正是一个非常激动人心的时刻。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.12,0:03:11.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,And that is a very same ambition and mindset with the semiconductors make across the ocean.\N这种雄心和思维方式，与跨洋的半导体产业如出一辙。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.28,0:03:14.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,The spark the creation of Silicon Island.\N点燃了硅岛诞生的火花。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.04,0:03:17.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right here in Taiwan.\N就在这里，台湾。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.32,0:03:27.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I have been very fortunate to associate with the creation of semiconductor industry in Taiwan 40 years ago.\N我非常幸运地在40年前参与了台湾半导体产业的创建。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.20,0:03:30.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh because uh 40 years ago uh Minister K.T.\N嗯，40年前，嗯，K.T. 李部长。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.99,0:03:39.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Li uh Li Kwoh-Ting to turn uh invite me to lay the foundation of venture capital concept in Taiwan.\N李国鼎先生邀请我，在台湾建立风险投资的概念。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.88,0:03:42.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's a very new concept.\N这是一个非常新颖的概念。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.38,0:03:46.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,And uh and I'll you people put money with you.\N而且，我会让你们把资金交给我。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.52,0:03:53.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,And you play the money, and then you share the profit of 20%, but you don't share 20% of the losses.\N你投入资金，然后分享20%的利润，但不承担20%的亏损。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.60,0:03:59.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, this is a very unique uh venture capital concept, but I managed to do that.\N所以，这是一个非常独特的风险投资理念，但我成功做到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.57,0:04:02.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,And then with the help of Minister K.T.\N然后在K.T.李部长和开发基金的帮助下，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.56,0:04:07.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Li and then development fund, and I set up my venture fund.\N我建立了自己的风险投资基金。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.16,0:04:17.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,And about the same time, you know, uh uh Morris Chang uh from TI came back to ITRI and then then set up the TSMC.\N大约在同一时期，来自德州仪器的张忠谋先生回到工研院，随后成立了台积电。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.18,0:04:17.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,So,\N所以，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.55,0:04:22.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's a very exciting time that I'm being involved in this whole science\N这是一段非常激动人心的时光，我有幸参与了整个科学园区
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.76,0:04:28.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,park and uh Hsinchu Science Park and the foundation of become the Silicon Island.\N以及新竹科学园区的建设，并见证了“硅岛”的诞生。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.68,0:04:34.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, I really see the benefit of, you know, uh from OEM,\N我真正看到了来自OEM、
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.64,0:04:40.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,ODM, from design to manufacturing, it's all here in Taiwan.\NODM，从设计到制造，所有环节都在台湾汇聚。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.80,0:04:48.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Taiwan PC ecosystem has played a critical role uh in Intel growth and success.\N台湾的个人电脑生态系统在英特尔的成长与成功中发挥了关键作用。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.76,0:04:56.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,I In fact, last year I was here uh to celebrate Intel 40th anniversary in Taiwan.\N实际上，去年我就是在这里，为英特尔在台湾的40周年庆典而来。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.08,0:05:07.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,I want to thank all of the suppliers, partners, and customers for 40 years of partnership with Intel.\N我想感谢所有供应商、合作伙伴和客户，感谢过去40年与英特尔的携手合作。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.60,0:05:15.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,As partnership continue to grow, Thank you.\N随着合作持续深化，谢谢大家。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.60,0:05:25.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,As partnership continue to grow and uh stronger every year.\N随着合作每年都在不断深化和加强。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.84,0:05:31.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,It had been a year since I stepped in uh the role of Intel CEO.\N自从我接任英特尔首席执行官一职已经过去一年了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.52,0:05:36.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,To be more precise, 14 months uh to being CEO of Intel.\N更准确地说，担任英特尔首席执行官已满14个月。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.73,0:05:47.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it may be the first CEO can speak Mandarin.\N这可能是第一位能说普通话的首席执行官。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.60,0:05:53.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,And in fact, of uh customer of Taiwan, very important partner for us,\N事实上，台湾的客户对我们来说是非常重要的合作伙伴，
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.60,0:06:01.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,is that they all also very unusual have a CEO can drink liquor with us.\N而且他们也都很特别，他们的首席执行官能和我们一同饮酒。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.04,0:06:05.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,But anyway, it's I'm part of this community.\N但无论如何，我已融入这个社区。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.16,0:06:10.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Execution has always always at the top of my list.\N执行始终是我最优先考虑的事情。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.12,0:06:15.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,To do so, we had that to bring focus back to the core.\N为此，我们必须把重心重新放回核心业务。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.40,0:06:19.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh at our heart, Intel is a engineering company.\N从根本上说，英特尔是一家工程公司。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.18,0:06:26.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,And that's what I decided from day one I came to become CEO of Intel, I have all the engineering report to me.\N从我第一天成为英特尔首席执行官起，我就决定要把所有工程报告都掌握在自己手中。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.56,0:06:33.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,So that understanding to really drive the engineering drives success in engineering uh performing.\N正是这种对工程的深刻理解，真正推动了工程的成功与卓越表现。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.60,0:06:43.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our customer and partners are always uh you know, already seen the shift uh in the Intel showed up.\N我们的客户和合作伙伴早已察觉到英特尔的转变，他们已经看到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.88,0:06:46.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh we're just getting started.\N我们才刚刚开始。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.33,0:06:47.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, stay tuned.\N所以，请继续关注。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.59,0:06:49.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have a journey in front of us.\N我们前方还有很长的路要走。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.74,0:06:52.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Opportunity ahead is enormous.\N未来的机遇无比巨大。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.00,0:06:59.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,And our job is to stay focused, execute, and deliver.\N我们的工作就是保持专注，高效执行并如期交付。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.96,0:07:01.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every year,\N每一年，
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.34,0:07:13.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Intel ship hundred millions of uh hundreds of millions of uh SOC orchestrating silicon across every industry.\N英特尔出货数亿颗片上系统，协调着横跨各个行业的芯片。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.16,0:07:22.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Working tightly with our partners ecosystem across each layer of the stack.\N我们与合作伙伴生态系统紧密协作，覆盖从底层到顶层的每一层技术栈。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.28,0:07:28.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,From silicon to SOC to system and to software.\N从芯片到片上系统，再到系统和软件。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.40,0:07:35.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,This generates trillions of dollars in value across four core compute ecosystem.\N这四个核心计算生态系统共同创造了数万亿美元的价值。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.88,0:07:39.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,First, personal computers.\N首先是个人电脑。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.00,0:07:46.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Second, edge, agentic AI and later physical AI.\N其次是边缘计算、代理型AI，以及未来的物理AI。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.44,0:07:51.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Third, foundational data centers.\N第三是基础数据中心。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.68,0:08:00.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,And finally, emerging intelligence centers that will power digital agents of the future.\N最后是将为未来数字代理提供动力的新兴智能中心。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.24,0:08:08.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Each of these ecosystem represent generational opportunity.\N这些生态系统均代表了世代性的机遇。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.16,0:08:15.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,And increasingly, each of these will need purpose-built CPU, GPU,\N越来越多地，这些领域都需要为特定工作负载和应用量身定制的CPU、GPU，
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.12,0:08:23.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,and A6 solutions caters for specific workloads and application.\N以及A6解决方案。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.60,0:08:34.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,The silicon we are building now will be for human use and the digital agent use.\N我们目前正在构建的芯片，将用于人类和数字代理。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.16,0:08:38.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let us begin with the ecosystem that started all.\N让我们从开启一切的生态系统开始。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.76,0:08:42.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,To talk more about about the PC ecosystem,\N想了解更多关于个人电脑生态系统的信息，
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.18,0:08:50.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,please join me to welcome to stage our new leaders for client compute and physical AI,\N请随我一起欢迎我们客户端计算和物理AI的新任负责人登台。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.00,0:08:59.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Alex.\N阿历克斯。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.96,0:09:00.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\N谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.73,0:09:01.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\N谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.51,0:09:02.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\N谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.28,0:09:04.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Lip-Bu.\N谢谢立武。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.08,0:09:05.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,A story about me.\N一个关于我的故事。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.55,0:09:10.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,The first time I came to Taiwan was the year 1990.\N我第一次来台湾是1990年。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.12,0:09:19.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I was fresh out of school, first job, first international trip, and I came right here in Taipei.\N当时我刚毕业，第一份工作，第一次出国旅行，我就直接来到了台北。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.16,0:09:26.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I quickly realized even back then that you know, this the the desire to grow,\N我很快意识到，即使在那时候，你们对成长的渴望，
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.72,0:09:35.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,uh the mindset of win-win and cooperation is all over all of our customers and our partners here in Taiwan.\N这种共赢与合作的思维，早已遍布台湾所有客户和合作伙伴之中。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.96,0:09:44.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,And now, forward the clock 36 years, I'm here in my first international trip with all the great people here at Intel.\N如今，时光飞逝36年，我再次来到这里，与英特尔的各位杰出人士开启我的第一次国际之旅。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.84,0:09:46.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,And where do I come?\N我从哪里来？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.28,0:09:48.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right here to Taipei.\N就在这里，台北。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.72,0:09:52.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\N谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.00,0:09:56.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to plan and build the future with you guys.\N我迫不及待要和大家一起规划并打造未来。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.84,0:09:57.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, let's get started.\N那么，我们开始吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.64,0:09:59.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have a lot to cover.\N我们要讲的内容很多。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.00,0:10:06.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Intel has continuously increased the pace of progress across all PC segments.\N英特尔持续加快了在所有PC领域的进步步伐。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.84,0:10:14.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Workstations, desktops, creators, gamers, premium and mainstream laptops.\N工作站、台式机、创作者、游戏玩家、高端和主流笔记本电脑。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.12,0:10:23.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every major segment, every major segment is driven by an Intel system solution.\N每个主要领域，每个主要领域都由英特尔系统解决方案驱动。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.84,0:10:33.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,With that vast coverage in mind, we're adding another dimension to scale these products even more effectively.\N考虑到如此广泛的覆盖范围，我们正在为这些产品增加另一个维度，以更有效地实现规模化。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.32,0:10:38.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Intel 18A process is now at full scale.\N英特尔18A工艺现已全面量产。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.68,0:10:44.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have a full lineup of products with hundreds of design wins to prove that.\N我们已推出完整的产品阵容，数百个设计胜出案例足以证明这一点。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.48,0:10:54.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,At CES, we launched the Core Ultra Series 3, Intel's first product built on 18A process technology.\N在CES上，我们推出了酷睿Ultra系列3，这是英特尔首款基于18A工艺技术的产品。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.72,0:11:02.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's setting a new standard for premium mobile performance and battery life.\N它为高端移动性能和电池续航树立了新标准。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.20,0:11:11.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Ultra Series 3 enables great user experiences across any tasks with a very fast response CPU,\NUltra 系列 3 搭载了响应迅速的 CPU，可为各种任务提供出色的用户体验，
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.76,0:11:19.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,a highly improved GPU, low power processing NPU, and the latest multimedia capabilities.\N性能大幅提升的GPU、低功耗的处理NPU以及最新的多媒体功能。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.92,0:11:28.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's a perfect blend of IP, performance, and power for any AI and agentic experience.\N这是适用于任何AI和代理体验的IP、性能与功耗的完美结合。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.56,0:11:40.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's allowing us to lead the way to transform every PC, every PC to an agentic capable platform.\N它使我们能够引领变革，将每台个人电脑转变为具备代理能力的平台。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.36,0:11:50.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today, more than 300 designs are shipping across consumer and commercial segments, over 300.\N如今，已有超过300款设计产品在消费级和商用领域出货。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.32,0:11:54.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,And to scale these capabilities even further,\N为了进一步扩展这些能力，
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.00,0:12:04.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,we've taken the latest Core Ultra IPs and specifically tailored them for the mainstream market.\N我们已将最新的酷睿Ultra IP进行了优化，专为大众市场打造。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.72,0:12:06.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,The result?\N结果是？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.32,0:12:09.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Intel Core Series 3, introduced in April.\N英特尔酷睿系列3，四月发布。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.04,0:12:13.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let me repeat, we just introduced this in April.\N让我再强调一遍，我们只是在四月份才推出这项技术。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.60,0:12:17.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it's already scaled up to 70 plus designs.\N而且它已经扩展到70多种设计以上。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.56,0:12:20.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,That brings Thank you.\N这就谢谢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.96,0:12:22.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\N谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.72,0:12:29.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,That brings the total series lineup to nearly 400 designs in just a few short months.\N这使得该系列的总设计数量在短短几个月内接近400款。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.36,0:12:34.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, that is massive scale.\N现在，这规模真是巨大。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.56,0:12:40.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's look at some of the capabilities of the Core Series 3, and we can start with battery life.\N我们来看一下Core系列3的一些功能，可以从电池续航开始。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.60,0:12:43.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know, I can go over these numbers here that are printed,\N我可以在这里讲解一下这些印刷出来的数据，
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.48,0:12:49.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,and I can talk about how we measure them and things like that, but I I have a question for you guys.\N也可以谈谈我们是如何测量它们以及类似的问题，但我有个问题想问问你们。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.16,0:12:51.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,How long is your day?\N你们的一天有多长？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.16,0:12:52.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,10 hours?\N10小时？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.60,0:12:54.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,12 hours?\N12小时？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.28,0:12:56.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,14 hours?\N14小时？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.48,0:13:00.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Or more like us at Intel?\N或者像我们英特尔一样更久？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.52,0:13:09.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,But the great user experience is if your PC lasts longer than your work day, and that's exactly what we're delivering in all segments.\N但真正的用户体验是你的电脑续航时间超过工作日，而这正是我们在所有产品线中所实现的。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.64,0:13:15.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we support ample number of ports for all of your connectivity needs.\N我们提供了充足的接口，满足你所有的连接需求。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.96,0:13:23.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Unlike some of our competitors who only have one USB-C interface, but I'll let you be the judge of that one.\N与一些竞争对手仅配备一个USB-C接口不同，这一点就由你来判断吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.92,0:13:28.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.\N没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.28,0:13:38.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,The goal of this uh platform Core Series 3 is to bring premium feel and experiences to incredibly thin form factors for mainstream PCs.\N这款Core系列3平台的目标是，为大众市场的电脑带来高端的质感与体验，同时实现极薄的机身设计。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.00,0:13:41.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,And you know, you don't have to take my word for it.\N你不必听我一个人说。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.12,0:13:51.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can look at this wall of incredibly designed sleek PCs that are here, and all of it is thanks to you, our partners and our customers.\N你可以看看这里展示的这些设计精美、线条流畅的电脑，这一切都归功于你们，我们的合作伙伴和客户。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.11,0:13:52.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,We couldn't have done it without you.\N没有你们，我们无法做到这一切。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.64,0:13:58.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, please, a round of applause.\N所以，请大家鼓掌。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.56,0:14:00.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Isn't it awesome?\N难道不棒吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.36,0:14:04.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Super light, super thin, really great.\N超轻、超薄，非常出色。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.12,0:14:04.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay.\N好的。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.64,0:14:10.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, the next proof is scaling 18A IP into growing markets.\N现在，下一个证明是将18A IP扩展到不断增长的市场。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.64,0:14:15.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the fastest growing portion of the PC market is the handheld gaming.\N个人电脑市场中增长最快的部分是掌上游戏。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.44,0:14:38.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's\N我们
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.58,0:14:57.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,take\N来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.86,0:15:05.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,a\N看
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.58,0:15:28.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,look.\N一看。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.72,0:15:33.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the Arc G3.\N这是Arc G3。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.04,0:15:42.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,I think a beautiful chip, more beautiful than was presented yesterday at the keynote.\N我觉得这是一颗非常漂亮的芯片，比昨天主题演讲中展示的还要漂亮。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.92,0:15:46.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay.\N好的。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.20,0:15:56.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,The G3 is derived from the Core Ultra Series 3, and Arc G3 is a tuned high-performance GPU specifically for handheld gaming.\NG3源自Core Ultra系列3，Arc G3是一款专为掌上游戏优化的高性能GPU。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.36,0:15:59.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it's providing great battery life.\N并且它提供了出色的续航能力。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.84,0:16:06.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,The performance tested across multiple games is consistent and stable versus competition.\N在多款游戏中的性能测试显示，其表现相较于竞争对手更加一致且稳定。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.72,0:16:14.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are more than 40% faster, 40% faster, and at the same performance, we're half the power.\N我们的性能提升超过40%，在相同性能下功耗降低一半。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.00,0:16:23.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,And on top of that, we're running all AAA games at 1080p resolution, many of them above 120 frames per second.\N此外，我们能在1080p分辨率下运行所有AAA游戏，其中许多游戏帧率超过120帧每秒。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.92,0:16:29.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, that is giving gamers a great user experience.\N这为玩家带来了出色的用户体验。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.32,0:16:35.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,All of these devices will be available later this month, and is just the beginning.\N这些设备将在本月晚些时候上市，这只是开始。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.04,0:16:42.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're going to have plenty more designs coming throughout the year.\N今年我们还将推出更多设计。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.44,0:16:43.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\N谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.56,0:16:45.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\N谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.04,0:16:50.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay, it is indeed true that Intel has a leading lineup of processors.\N好的，英特尔确实拥有领先的处理器产品线。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.63,0:16:56.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,And with the versatility of the 18A process technology, our newest offerings,\N凭借18A制程技术的灵活性，我们最新的产品，
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.41,0:17:02.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,we're bringing powerful performance and efficiency to scale across the breadth of premium,\N将为高端、主流及移动游戏领域提供强大的性能与效率。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.67,0:17:09.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,mainstream, and handheld gaming segments.\N这些相同的基础、相同的知识产权和相同的能力，可以超越个人电脑生态系统实现更广泛的应用。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.68,0:17:19.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,These same fundamentals, the same IP, the same capabilities, can deliver far beyond the PC ecosystem.\N这些相同的基础、相同的知识产权和相同的能力，可以超越个人电脑生态系统实现更广泛的应用。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.48,0:17:26.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,The demand for our processors at the edge has been booming.\N我们在边缘计算领域的处理器需求正在迅猛增长。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.52,0:17:34.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,As you've seen, we've already taken existing product lines and pivoted them into adjacent markets,\N正如你们所见，我们已经将现有产品线转向了相邻市场，
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.61,0:17:39.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,enabling our customers to grow their businesses.\N从而帮助客户拓展业务。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.12,0:17:42.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, the edge is demanding the latest products from Intel.\N如今，边缘计算领域迫切需要英特尔最新的产品。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.91,0:17:54.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,And that's why this year we're taking our latest Series 3 products into the edge business with over 130 designs in multiple verticals.\N因此，今年我们将最新的系列3产品投入边缘计算业务，涵盖超过130种不同领域的设计。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.16,0:18:00.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,For large-scale edge business, our customers need the best technology and chipsets,\N对于大规模边缘计算业务，客户需要最先进的技术和芯片组，
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.64,0:18:06.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,easy-to-use reference designs, and appropriate software stacks.\N易于使用的参考设计以及合适的软件栈。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.24,0:18:10.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,And at Intel, we've done all of that.\N而在英特尔，我们已经全部实现。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.96,0:18:21.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have over 4,000 edge ecosystem partners deploying into such verticals such as manufacturing, robotics, retail, and many more.\N我们拥有超过4000家边缘生态系统合作伙伴，正在向制造、机器人、零售等多个垂直领域部署。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.76,0:18:30.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,For those of you here at Computex, you can see some of that at the pavilion.\N在场的各位如果在Computex，可以在展馆里看到部分成果。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.24,0:18:35.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Given that capability, given the IP, given the chipsets, given the scale that we have,\N凭借我们的能力、知识产权、芯片组以及规模，
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.37,0:18:41.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,there's a massive opportunity ahead of us across many segments of physical AI.\N我们在物理AI的众多细分领域面前，正面临巨大的机遇。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.68,0:18:46.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's projected to be a 25 trillion market by 2050.\N预计到2050年，市场规模将达到25万亿美元。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.52,0:18:53.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it will leverage all of our scale in the PC ecosystem.\N它将充分利用我们在个人电脑生态系统中的规模优势。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.80,0:19:01.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Physical AI form factors will take shape across key industries as you see behind me.\N你在我身后看到的各个关键行业中，物理AI的形态将逐渐成形。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.36,0:19:09.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,We will continue growing these markets with the same strategy of leading IP and chipsets, complete reference platforms,\N我们将继续以相同的策略拓展这些市场，即领先的核心知识产权和芯片组、完整的参考平台，
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.84,0:19:20.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,of end-user hardware, and applicable software stacks, enabling our customers to expand into new physical AI form factors and applications.\N面向终端用户的硬件以及适用的软件栈，帮助客户拓展至新的物理AI形态和应用场景。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.40,0:19:23.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,And indeed, this will be our future.\N这确实将是我们的未来。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.00,0:19:26.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, back to you, Lipu.\N现在，交还给你，立武。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.20,0:19:33.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\N谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.60,0:19:38.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\N谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.16,0:19:40.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh thanks, Alex.\N嗯，谢谢，亚历克斯。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.64,0:19:46.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,AI is profoundly impacting the way we use our devices.\NAI正在深刻改变我们使用设备的方式。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.20,0:19:52.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,A major focus area for us is the use of AI on device.\N我们的一个重点方向是设备端的AI应用。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.04,0:19:59.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Together with partners, we are at the forefront of advancing intelligence.\N与合作伙伴携手，我们正处在推动智能发展的最前沿。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.20,0:20:00.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,To tell you more about it,\N让我为您多介绍一下。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.79,0:20:02.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,let me welcome on stage my\N请允许我邀请我的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.82,0:20:04.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,close friend and\N亲密朋友，
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.20,0:20:15.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,founder CEO of Perplexity,\N以及 Perplexity 的创始人兼首席执行官，
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.15,0:20:18.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Aravind.\N阿拉文德上台。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.80,0:20:21.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, Aravind, welcome.\N欢迎你，阿拉文德。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.20,0:20:25.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,You and I have been talking about hybrid compute for a while.\N你我已就混合计算讨论了一段时间。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.61,0:20:29.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,The reason why are clear.\N原因显而易见。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.12,0:20:32.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know, the privacy, cost, performance.\N你知道，隐私、成本、性能。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.92,0:20:37.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,And let's talk about how to make this work.\N那我们来谈谈如何让这成为现实。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.20,0:20:37.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.\N没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.73,0:20:42.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, in February, we launched Perplexity Compute.\N因此，二月份我们推出了 Perplexity Compute。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.48,0:20:45.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Compute is an AI operating system.\NCompute 是一个 AI 操作系统。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.40,0:20:51.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,It creates a team of agents, uses up to 20 different AI models,\N它创建了一个代理团队，可使用多达 20 种不同的 AI 模型，
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.96,0:20:59.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,and it orchestrates across models, tools, and files in one single system.\N并在单一系统中协调模型、工具和文件之间的协作。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.68,0:21:08.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,The agent harness inside Compute is model agnostic, perfectly balancing intelligence,\NCompute 内部的代理引擎具备模型无关性，完美平衡了智能、
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.20,0:21:14.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,accuracy, privacy, and cost is the orchestration problem it solves.\N准确性、隐私和成本，这正是它所解决的协调问题。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.80,0:21:24.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, this allows you to run smaller models locally on the Intel Core Ultra Series 3 GPU.\N因此，你现在可以在英特尔 Core Ultra 系列 3 GPU 上本地运行更小的模型。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.52,0:21:32.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, for the first time ever, we work together to create hybrid generative inference.\N这是史上首次，我们携手合作，实现了混合生成式推理。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.04,0:21:36.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, what we're showing today is just the start.\N因此，今天我们展示的只是开始。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.84,0:21:47.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hybrid generative inference is how we maximize token value per watt per user.\N混合生成式推理正是我们实现每瓦特每用户最大词元价值的方式。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.08,0:21:49.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, should we show them how it works?\N那么，我们该展示它是如何工作的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.04,0:21:54.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yep.\N好的。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.00,0:21:56.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,All right.\N好的。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.40,0:21:58.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, here it is.\N那么，这就是它。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.44,0:22:09.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's say I'm an associate at a private equity firm, and I'm working on something that has a confidential project code name Project Falcon.\N假设我是一家私募股权公司的合伙人，正在处理一个机密项目，代号为“猎鹰项目”。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.24,0:22:13.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Here is the query.\N这是查询内容。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.36,0:22:21.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, think of it as me trying to understand if a certain private company is worth $1.1 billion,\N想象一下，我正在评估某家私人公司是否值11亿美元，
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.69,0:22:27.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,and I'm feeding it And I'm feeding it confidential deal materials.\N我正在输入并输入机密交易资料。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.72,0:22:30.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,The work begins on the laptop.\N工作从笔记本电脑开始。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.72,0:22:36.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,It sees that Project Falcon has private deal room files.\N它发现“猎鹰项目”有私密的交易室文件。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.92,0:22:47.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,And an NDA, a local leverage buyout financial model, a whiteboard diagram, and bilingual transcripts that are very confidential.\N还有保密协议、本地杠杆收购财务模型、白板图示，以及非常机密的双语文字记录。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.06,0:22:50.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,You don't want these materials to be shipped to the server.\N你不希望这些资料被传送到服务器。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.44,0:23:01.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, what the local model does on the Core Ultra Series 3 is it first decides this is all very important work and shouldn't be sent to the server.\N因此，Core Ultra 系列 3 上的本地模型会首先判断，这些工作非常重要，不应发送到服务器。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.41,0:23:05.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,It reads the files, classifies what is sensitive and what is not.\N它读取文件，识别出哪些内容敏感，哪些不敏感。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.68,0:23:10.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,And then computer decides what should leave the device and what shouldn't.\N然后，计算机决定哪些内容应留在设备上，哪些应移出。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.44,0:23:16.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,And each of these things is done with local AI.\N这些操作都是通过本地AI完成的。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.12,0:23:21.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,The orchestrator can spin up additional agents as necessary.\N调度器可根据需要启动额外的智能体。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.68,0:23:32.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, if you need a research agent to bring in outside file materials against local model without exposing any private files,\N因此，如果你需要一个研究智能体，从外部获取文件资料，同时不暴露任何私有文件，仅基于本地模型进行操作，
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.32,0:23:34.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,that's what you want in the hybrid system.\N这正是混合系统所具备的功能。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.82,0:23:40.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, computer or acts as one single system, brings all inputs and outputs together.\N于是，计算机或作为单一系统，将所有输入和输出整合在一起。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.04,0:23:51.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, let's actually skip and see what the actual result would be.\N那么，我们不妨跳过，直接看看实际结果会是什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.08,0:23:51.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,All right.\N好的。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.74,0:23:56.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, the result is a document, a research report, and supporting data.\N结果是一个文档、一份研究报告以及支持性数据。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.56,0:24:05.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it's being created by agents on large cloud-based models keeping your sensitive information only on your device.\N这些内容由基于大型云模型的智能体生成，同时将敏感信息仅保留在你的设备上。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.72,0:24:11.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, all your local device models will take care of the private files,\N因此，所有本地设备模型将负责处理私有文件，
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.43,0:24:16.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,and the server-side models will take care of other things through hybrid inference orchestration.\N而服务器端模型则通过混合推理调度处理其他任务。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.96,0:24:19.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the architecture we both believe in.\N这是我们双方都坚信的架构。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.00,0:24:28.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the future is more compute in the data center and more compute on the local machine.\N未来数据中心的计算量将更多，本地设备上的计算量也将更多。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.36,0:24:38.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, I think of this as a big milestone for engineering on both the agent harness AI side as well as the chip side.\N因此，我认为这在智能体赋能AI和芯片两个领域都具有重大的工程里程碑意义。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.56,0:24:42.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, um it's been really fun to partner with you and Intel on this.\N所以，与你们和英特尔合作，真的非常愉快。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.29,0:24:44.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, thank you so much, Lip-Bu.\N非常感谢你，立武。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.08,0:24:44.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,Definitely.\N当然。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.82,0:24:48.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Arvind, and looking forward to continue partnership.\N谢谢你，阿文德，期待继续合作。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.32,0:24:54.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\N谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.24,0:25:02.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,We talk a lot about the exciting new developments in the PC, Edge, and physical AI space.\N我们经常讨论PC、边缘计算和物理AI领域令人兴奋的新进展。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.36,0:25:10.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,I want to take a few minutes to talk about the foundational IP that power all these advancements.\N我想花几分钟时间谈谈推动所有这些进步的基础性知识产权。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.12,0:25:15.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let us talk about x86.\N让我们来谈谈x86。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.48,0:25:22.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,When most people think of general-purpose computing, they think x86.\N当大多数人想到通用计算时，他们会想到x86。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.80,0:25:25.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,And that is a good reason for that.\N这是一个很好的理由。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.52,0:25:36.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,x86 is architecture that has power data center for nearly five decades.\Nx86 架构在过去近半个世纪里一直是数据中心的主流架构。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.12,0:25:38.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the leadership continues.\N领导地位持续保持。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.00,0:25:41.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh according to the IDC,\N据 IDC 数据显示，
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.40,0:25:51.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,expect eight out of the 10 servers installed through 2030 to be x86 base.\N预计到 2030 年安装的十台服务器中，有八台将基于 x86。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.08,0:26:00.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Powering modern computing from foundational to emerging intelligent use cases.\N从基础到新兴的智能应用场景，x86 正在推动现代计算的发展。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.80,0:26:12.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Intel pioneered most of the breakthrough architecture innovation that have enhanced x86 over the last four decades.\N过去四十年中，英特尔开创了大多数推动 x86 架构进步的关键创新。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.53,0:26:19.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Starting with the 8086 that become the foundation of modern computing.\N从 8086 开始，它成为现代计算的基石。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.04,0:26:21.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh you can see the chart.\N你可以看到这张图表。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.74,0:26:25.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today, we have two flagship CPU cores.\N如今，我们拥有两款旗舰 CPU 核心。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.72,0:26:28.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,P-cores and E-cores.\NP 核心和 E 核心。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.88,0:26:31.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,One optimized for performance.\N一个专为性能优化。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.64,0:26:37.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,One the others is for efficiency.\N另一个是用于效率。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.80,0:26:43.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,These are Intel's most advanced CPU cores with the accelerator\N这些是英特尔最先进的CPU核心，内置加速器。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.57,0:26:51.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,building built in uh specifically for foundational workloads like security.\N专为安全等基础工作负载而设计。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.12,0:27:02.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our x86 cores power our PC, client, edge portfolio, and also power our data center and AI portfolio.\N我们的x86核心驱动我们的PC、客户端、边缘产品组合，同时也驱动我们的数据中心和AI产品组合。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.00,0:27:10.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Under my leadership, we are committed to building the best CPU cores in the world.\N在我的领导下，我们致力于打造世界上最好的CPU核心。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.72,0:27:21.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we will enhance and sure that the most compute intensive workload run best on 8086. x86.\N我们将不断优化，确保最密集的计算工作负载在8086 x86平台上运行得最好。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.64,0:27:23.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Next, let us talk.\N接下来，让我们谈谈。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.72,0:27:27.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\N谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.80,0:27:35.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, let us talk about how x86 is enabling foundational data centers.\N现在，让我们谈谈x86如何推动基础数据中心的发展。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.80,0:27:37.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,To tell you more about it,\N为了更详细地说明这一点，
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.51,0:27:49.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,let me invite on to the stage Kavouk.\N让我邀请Kavouk上台。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.08,0:27:50.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\N谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.20,0:27:51.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\N谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.52,0:27:52.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Lisa.\N谢谢，丽莎。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.52,0:27:54.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wow, it's so great to be here.\N哇，能来到这里真是太棒了。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.60,0:28:04.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh specifically in this point in our history, global history, collective history, and be at Computex with a blue badge.\N尤其是在我们历史、全球历史和集体历史的这个节点上，能以蓝 badge 的身份参加 Computex，感觉特别好。
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.35,0:28:05.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, I'm very happy.\N所以，我非常开心。
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.24,0:28:10.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm very humbled to be here to share with you some of the innovations that we have.\N能在这里与大家分享我们的一些创新成果，我深感荣幸。
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.44,0:28:15.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, uh let's talk [snorts] a bit about uh see what this AI thing is about.\N那么，我们来聊聊[轻哼]，看看这个 AI 到底是怎么回事。
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.88,0:28:21.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, when we say foundational, we mean the workloads that keep the world running.\N当我们说“基础性”时，指的是支撑世界运转的工作负载。
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.70,0:28:30.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, currently we have data centers, and there's a number of items and workloads and entities that run on these data centers.\N目前我们有数据中心，许多项目、工作负载和实体都在这些数据中心上运行。
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.76,0:28:36.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, uh for example, we have 5G networks that uh keep us connected.\N举个例子，我们有 5G 网络，让我们的连接不断线。
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.36,0:28:40.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have databases that keep our data safe.\N我们有数据库，保护我们的数据安全。
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.20,0:28:44.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have cloud services that power our daily lives.\N我们有云服务，支撑着我们的日常生活。
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.08,0:28:55.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, we expect and demand for these workloads to to grow in size and capacity between now and 2030 from 80 gigawatts to about 100 gigawatts.\N因此，我们预计从现在到2030年，这些工作负载的规模和容量将从80吉瓦增长到约100吉瓦。
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.56,0:29:04.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,And yeah, most of you involved in this domain understand the the the the extent of this type of an expansion.\N而且，你们大多数参与这一领域的人都了解这种扩张的程度。
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.48,0:29:11.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,These workloads are broad, they are mission critical, so attention, especially attention has to be taken when running them.\N这些工作负载范围广泛，属于关键任务，因此在运行时必须格外注意。
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.98,0:29:18.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,But [clears throat] also they require performance, efficiency, security and resiliency.\N但[清了清嗓子]它们还需要性能、效率、安全性和韧性。
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.18,0:29:23.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we can't emphasize enough all these four factors.\N我们再怎么强调这四个因素都不为过。
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.72,0:29:31.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,That is why we are excited to have Intel Xeon 6 Plus introduced at the Computex this week.\N这就是为什么我们非常高兴地在本周的Computex上推出英特尔至强6 Plus。
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.12,0:29:42.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,It has 288 e-cores, a massive 576 megabytes of L3 cache, built with our Intel 18A technology,\N它拥有288个e-核，高达576兆字节的L3缓存，采用我们的英特尔18A技术制造。
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.54,0:29:50.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,and we can't emphasize enough the the value of Intel technology that brings to data center products.\N我们再怎么强调英特尔技术为数据中心产品带来的价值都不为过。
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.52,0:29:55.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,But most importantly, it delivers efficiency and density,\N但最重要的是，它实现了高效能和高密度。
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.04,0:30:06.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,which enables our partners to save very precious real estate, have more compact servers and the racks.\N这使得我们的合作伙伴能够节省极为宝贵的机房空间，实现更紧凑的服务器和机柜。
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.28,0:30:15.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, this is a leadership compute for the next era of cloud and network infrastructure.\N因此，这是面向下一代云和网络基础设施的领导级计算平台。
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.92,0:30:16.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,So,\N所以，
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.15,0:30:25.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Xeon 6 Plus launches with the strength of our ecosystem that's been built over decades and decades of data center development both from a hardware,\N至强 6 Plus 搭载了我们数十年来在数据中心领域积累的生态系统实力，涵盖硬件层面，
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.24,0:30:29.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,but also from a software and infrastructure perspective.\N也涵盖软件和基础设施层面。
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.64,0:30:36.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Moreover, our ODM partners are bringing Xeon 6 Plus solutions to the market today.\N此外，我们的 ODM 合作伙伴如今已将至强 6 Plus 解决方案推向市场。
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.60,0:30:44.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, these range from full rack scale deployments to server level designs.\N这些解决方案涵盖从整机架规模部署到服务器级设计的各类应用。
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.44,0:30:55.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Xeon 6 Plus joins our lineup of data center processors next to our already launched Xeon 6 based on P-cores.\N至强 6 Plus 将加入我们的数据中心处理器产品线，与已发布的基于 P 核的至强 6 并列。
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.52,0:31:01.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Both of these category and class of solutions delivers new performance and choice\N这两类解决方案均带来了全新的性能表现和选择空间，
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.85,0:31:09.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,for all the enterprises whose infrastructure backbone is built on x86 and Xeon.\N为所有以 x86 和至强作为基础设施核心的企业提供支持。
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.80,0:31:16.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is critical for enterprises that need to increasingly balance preparing for AI workloads,\N对那些需要日益平衡 AI 工作负载准备的企业而言，这一点至关重要，
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.52,0:31:24.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,but at the same time running their day-to-day mission-critical applications.\N同时还要保障日常关键业务应用的稳定运行。
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.20,0:31:32.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, let's switch gears and talk about how Intel would simplify the deployment of intelligence at scale.\N那么，让我们转换话题，谈谈英特尔将如何简化大规模智能部署。
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.36,0:31:39.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's undeniable that enterprise infrastructure today will have to evolve to keep up with the AI demand.\N不可否认，企业基础设施如今必须不断演进，以跟上 AI 的需求。
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.88,0:31:45.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,Recent research forecast that AI inference workloads are expected to become 40%\N最新研究预测，AI 推理工作负载预计占比将达到 40%
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.34,0:31:53.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,of all data center power demand and much more than they are today.\N以及远超当前水平的数据中心电力需求
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.12,0:31:59.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, we have these two paradigms where we have the foundational data centers keep on running their traditional workloads,\N因此，我们面临两种范式，即基础数据中心持续运行传统工作负载
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.76,0:32:05.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,but at the same time they have to figure out ways of building their infrastructures to serve intelligence at scale.\N同时又必须找到方法构建基础设施，以实现智能的规模化应用
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.76,0:32:16.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this is where Intel and Xeon 6 Plus come in.\N这正是英特尔和至强6 Plus的用武之地
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.76,0:32:21.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, up to now training split the data center into two.\N到目前为止，训练将数据中心划分为两个部分
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.84,0:32:29.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, on one hand we have CPU led enterprise infrastructure and the other hand we have GPU heavy AI factories.\N一方面是以CPU为主的企业基础设施，另一方面是以GPU为主的人工智能工厂
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.51,0:32:31.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,And that was very clear divide for a while, right?\N这种划分曾非常清晰，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.99,0:32:36.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we've all been accustomed to that that reality.\N我们所有人都已习惯这种现实
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.28,0:32:43.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,But as a gigantic AI moves into real workloads, data, tools, governance, the needs change.\N但随着大型人工智能进入实际工作负载、数据、工具和治理领域，需求发生了变化
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.32,0:32:49.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,The next wave is not just about training models, it is about putting AI to work.\N下一波浪潮不仅仅是训练模型，更是让人工智能真正投入工作
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.12,0:32:55.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, let's look at why a genetic AI changes the infrastructure equation.\N那么，让我们看看为什么基因组人工智能改变了基础设施的平衡
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.60,0:32:58.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,The way AI inference works is straightforward.\N人工智能推理的工作方式非常直接
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.48,0:32:59.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,We take a prompt.\N我们输入一个提示。
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.04,0:33:04.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,It gets fed into an LLM where it spends most time reasoning about the prompt.\N提示被输入到大语言模型中，模型大部分时间都在对提示进行推理。
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.56,0:33:07.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we all seen this, we've done this of times.\N我们都见过这种情况，也多次这样操作过。
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.32,0:33:09.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,And out comes an answer.\N然后输出一个答案。
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.04,0:33:20.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,In this case, a lot of time is spent computing the large language model, which is mostly GPU and compute intensive.\N在这种情况下，大量时间都花在计算大语言模型上，这主要依赖GPU和计算资源。
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.20,0:33:23.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, the way a genetic AI works is radically different.\N现在，遗传AI的工作方式截然不同。
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.00,0:33:27.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's given goals rather than prompts.\N它接收的是目标，而不是提示。
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.08,0:33:32.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, we've all seen the uh the different types of loop that people are running on this genetic AI.\N所以，我们都见过人们在遗传AI上运行的各种循环类型。
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.84,0:33:37.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's also very iterative in nature, but also prompted by automation.\N它也具有很强的迭代性，同时由自动化驱动。
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.36,0:33:45.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,And thinking, planning, acting, and reflecting are a natural way of these agents interacting with us.\N思考、规划、行动和反思，是这些智能体与我们互动的自然方式。
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.92,0:33:51.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,As it works, it uses tools, reads and writes files, checks rules,\N在运行过程中，它使用工具，读写文件，检查规则，
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.12,0:33:57.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,and other aspects that were you know, in the traditional realm of CPUs and x86.\N以及其他传统上属于CPU和x86架构的方面。
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.00,0:34:06.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,And then for each step, the type of underlying compute needs is very different and we'll show that in a bit.\N然后在每一步中，底层计算需求的类型差异非常大，我们稍后会展示这一点。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.36,0:34:13.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is particularly important as agents scale up their work, spawning new agents that work concurrently.\N当代理规模扩大并生成新的并发运行代理时，这一点尤为重要。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.36,0:34:22.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the category and the complexity of agents are going to be very different depending on the complexity of the work.\N代理的类别和复杂性将根据工作复杂性而有很大不同。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.12,0:34:26.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's the main reason that there's such a rapid increase in CPU demand.\N这正是CPU需求迅速增长的主要原因。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.12,0:34:31.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,For a genetic AI, the CPU orchestrates the show.\N对于基因AI而言，CPU负责协调整个流程。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.60,0:34:42.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, what we're seeing is we're also seeing the balance and the ratio of one CPU to eight GPU and more is is coming much closer to parity.\N现在我们看到的是，一台CPU与八块GPU甚至更多GPU之间的平衡和比例正在迅速接近均衡。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.24,0:34:44.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, let's take a look at the real example.\N那么，让我们来看一个真实案例。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.64,0:34:45.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,John.\N约翰。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.64,0:34:46.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Kevork.\N谢谢，凯沃克。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.40,0:34:49.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,You talked about how agentic AI is changing the compute requirements.\N你谈到了代理型AI如何改变计算需求。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.89,0:34:52.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's take a look at a real example.\N让我们来看一个真实案例。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.20,0:34:55.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have a traditional AI inference setup on the left-hand side of the screen.\N我在屏幕左侧有一个传统的AI推理部署。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.96,0:34:57.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's send a request.\N我们发送一个请求。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.72,0:35:02.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Write a Python function that calls an OpenAI compatible chat completions API.\N编写一个调用 OpenAI 兼容聊天补全 API 的 Python 函数。
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.84,0:35:07.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,The model gets the response, generates code, and sends the request back.\N模型获取响应，生成代码，并将请求返回。
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.96,0:35:10.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,Take a look at the slider on the top of the screen.\N看一下屏幕顶部的滑块。
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.74,0:35:15.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,GPU dominates nearly 7:1 GPU heavy.\NGPU 几乎以 7:1 的优势主导着 GPU 密集型任务。
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.48,0:35:19.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,In contrast, let's take a look at an agentic AI system.\N相比之下，我们来看一个代理式 AI 系统。
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.80,0:35:22.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Across the top, look at the pipeline stages.\N在顶部，查看流水线的各个阶段。
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.20,0:35:25.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Green is GPU work, blue is CPU work.\N绿色代表 GPU 任务，蓝色代表 CPU 任务。
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.88,0:35:31.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Linting is happening on our Xeon 6 plus processor with efficient efficiency cores.\N代码检查在我们的至强 6 加效核心处理器上高效运行。
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.76,0:35:37.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Web fetch and compile is happening on our Xeon 6 performance cores.\N网络获取和编译在我们的至强 6 性能核心上进行。
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.40,0:35:44.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,And unit testing is coming back and running on our Xeon 6 plus efficient efficiency cores.\N单元测试完成后，正在我们的至强 6 加效核心上运行。
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.16,0:35:47.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,The right class CPU for each stage of the pipeline.\N为流水线的每个阶段配备最合适的 CPU。
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.48,0:35:49.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Take a look at the slider across the top again.\N再看一下顶部的滑块。
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.88,0:35:54.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're near parity, but CPU heavy this time.\N我们接近平衡，但这次是CPU占主导。
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.64,0:36:01.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's this look like when we multiply that by millions of queries a day?\N当我们把这个乘以每天数百万次查询时，会是什么样子？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.24,0:36:06.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,As you mentioned, each Xeon 6 plus processor has up to 288 cores.\N正如你提到的，每个至强6处理器最多有288个核心。
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.27,0:36:12.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's 576 cores per two socket server.\N两个插槽的服务器共有576个核心。
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.08,0:36:21.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,When we look at that from a rack scale perspective, that gives us over 36,000 cores per 32 use of compute space.\N从机架规模来看，每32个计算空间可提供超过36,000个核心。
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.80,0:36:22.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, John.\N谢谢你，约翰。
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.96,0:36:30.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, this is pretty amazing and some data to ponder on.\N这确实非常惊人，值得深思。
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.96,0:36:38.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,By far, the the density of CPU we showed is is has the highest density per rack ever.\N无疑，我们展示的CPU密度是机架级别史上最高的。
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.64,0:36:44.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,But also, looking at the number of agents, and these are the new metrics that are emerging,\N同时，考虑到代理数量，这些是正在出现的新指标，
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.35,0:36:50.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,we can safely say that that particular rack can run up to 150,000 agents.\N我们可以肯定地说，该机架最多可运行15万个代理。
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.56,0:36:53.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, good news to all the CIOs in the audience.\N所以，对在场的所有CIO们来说，这是个好消息。
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.70,0:37:03.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, your very expensive GPUs can be can see more utilization because of our solutions.\N现在，得益于我们的解决方案，您昂贵的GPU可以实现更高的利用率。
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.32,0:37:10.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, what's Xeon 6 with P-cores and E-cores are built and for intelligence at scale.\N现在，Xeon 6 采用P-cores和E-cores架构，专为大规模智能计算而设计。
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.44,0:37:17.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,They are different cores, of course, but we've seen the workloads that require very high-performance cores pushing the frequencies,\N它们当然是不同的核心，但我们已经看到，需要高性能核心并提升频率的工作负载。
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.92,0:37:22.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,but also there's a need for a very high-density power-efficient cores.\N但同时，也需要高密度、高能效的核心。
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.08,0:37:31.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, we've seen all the workloads, we've run all the analysis, and we are delivering these solutions to to all of you.\N因此，我们已经分析了所有工作负载，完成了全部分析，并将这些解决方案提供给你们。
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.28,0:37:34.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, having said that,\N话虽如此，
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.04,0:37:43.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,we are working with our customers and partners to make sure that each solution is tailored to to your needs.\N我们正与客户和合作伙伴紧密合作，确保每个解决方案都符合您的需求。
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.68,0:37:51.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, I'd like to welcome Libu back on stage to talk about the server and rack sale solutions that our partners are working on.\N因此，我很高兴邀请立武再次登台，为大家介绍我们的合作伙伴正在开发的服务器和机架解决方案。
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.02,0:37:56.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\N谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.80,0:37:57.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, my friend.\N谢谢，我的朋友。
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.92,0:38:00.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\N谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.16,0:38:02.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\N谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.40,0:38:04.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh thank you, Kavouk.\N嗯，谢谢，卡沃克。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.32,0:38:11.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is great to see the momentum in the data center.\N看到数据中心的势头，真是太好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.20,0:38:20.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,As we look forward to see that is for intelligence at scale, discrete compute alone is not enough.\N展望未来，要实现大规模智能，仅靠离散计算是不够的。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.44,0:38:30.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our customer are asking us to think of system level to help them surf real authentic workloads at scale.\N我们的客户要求我们从系统层面思考，帮助他们大规模应对真实、真实的负载。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.68,0:38:40.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,It pushed us to rethink how we deliver our compute beyond the socket and to the rack.\N这促使我们重新思考如何将计算能力从芯片扩展到机架。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.72,0:38:46.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,That is why we start the initiative called Rack Scale blueprints.\N这就是我们启动名为“机架规模蓝图”倡议的原因。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.59,0:38:56.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,[snorts] Working with ecosystem partners to develop Rack Scale blueprints built on open standards.\N[嗤笑] 与生态系统合作伙伴协作，基于开放标准开发机架规模蓝图。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.52,0:39:07.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, customer can rapidly scale their intelligent infrastructure with confident without proprietary workarounds.\N这样，客户就能自信地快速扩展其智能基础设施，无需依赖专有解决方案。
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.00,0:39:12.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Behind me, as you can see, two examples of these blueprints.\N在我身后，你们可以看到这两个蓝图的实例。
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.96,0:39:20.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,One is for authentic performance based on Intel Xeon 6 with P-cores.\N一个是基于英特尔至强6处理器P核的真实性能方案。
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.80,0:39:29.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,The other is agent density with the Intel Xeon 6 Plus with E-cores.\N另一个是基于英特尔至强6 Plus处理器E核的代理密度方案。
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.08,0:39:39.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are working closely with our partners ecosystem including Foxconn, SambaNova to expand our Rack Scale offering.\N我们正与富士康、SambaNova等合作伙伴生态系统紧密合作，拓展我们的机架规模产品。
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.72,0:39:46.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let me call on stage one of our partners, chief product officer of Foxconn,\N让我邀请一位合作伙伴上台，富士康首席产品官何晓明，
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.48,0:39:55.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Jerry Hsiao, to talk about how we partners on Rack Scale solution.\N他将分享我们如何合作开发机架规模解决方案。
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.36,0:39:58.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,[clears throat] Thank you, Lip-Bu.\N[清了清嗓子] 谢谢立武。
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.16,0:40:00.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Jerry.\N谢谢，何晓明。
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.80,0:40:03.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um I'm so excited to be here today.\N噢，今天能来到这里我非常激动。
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.48,0:40:09.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wonderful product and amazing event.\N产品非常出色，活动也令人惊叹。
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.28,0:40:15.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,Jerry, Intel and Foxconn have been working together to many decades,\N何晓明，英特尔和富士康已携手合作数十年，
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.23,0:40:25.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,and Foxconn has been instrumental in driving technology innovation in Taiwan and around the world.\N富士康在推动台湾乃至全球的技术创新方面发挥了关键作用。
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.08,0:40:26.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right, Lip-Bu.\N没错，立武。
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.00,0:40:38.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um I'm proud the work we have done together from AI servers to data centers and to edge computing all together.\N我很自豪我们共同完成的工作，从AI服务器到数据中心，再到边缘计算，全方位推进。
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.36,0:40:44.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,And today we're excited to announce the next step in our partnership.\N今天，我们很高兴宣布双方合作的下一步进展。
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.68,0:40:52.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,Intel and Foxconn are working together to develop rack-scale products built upon Intel Xeon processors.\N英特尔和富士康正携手开发基于英特尔至强处理器的机架规模产品。
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.03,0:40:59.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,Together, we will focus on exploring the development, integrations,\N共同努力，我们将专注于探索发展与集成，
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.34,0:41:09.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,and commercialization of differentiated uh uh rack-scale AI infrastructure solution leveraging com-\N以及利用通用架构的差异化机架级AI基础设施解决方案的商业化
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.77,0:41:16.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,complementary architecture to address diverse AI workload requirements.\N互补架构，以满足多样化的AI工作负载需求。
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.28,0:41:23.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah, together we will continue to deepen and expand our partnership unlocking new opportunities ahead.\N是的，我们将继续深化并拓展合作，共同开启新的机遇。
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.00,0:41:25.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Through this collaboration,\N通过此次合作，
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.65,0:41:36.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,we will deliver system-level AI solution to our joint customers enabling more integrated and scalable computing environments.\N我们将为我们的联合客户交付系统级AI解决方案，助力构建更加集成和可扩展的计算环境。
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.04,0:41:45.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,This makes it marks an important step ahead and we look forward unveiling more in the near future.\N这标志着迈出了重要的一步，我们期待在不久的将来公布更多内容。
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.95,0:41:47.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Lip-Bu.\N谢谢，立武。
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.84,0:41:54.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today is an exciting uh milestone for our continued partnership uh with Foxconn.\N今天是我们与富士康持续合作的一个令人激动的里程碑。
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.98,0:41:57.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Jerry, thank you for joining us.\N杰里，感谢你加入我们。
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.12,0:41:57.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fantastic.\N太棒了。
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.68,0:42:07.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you for having me, Lip-Bu.\N谢谢你的邀请，立武。
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.84,0:42:17.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you to the many partners in the audience today that is helping to bring this Rex Scale vision to life.\N感谢今天在场的众多合作伙伴，正是你们的帮助让这一瑞克斯规模愿景得以实现。
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.12,0:42:29.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Providing choice throughout uh through the ecosystem power, uh we do not believe one size fit all approach for intelligent centers.\N在整个生态系统中提供选择，我们并不认为智能中心适合采用一刀切的方案。
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.08,0:42:33.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,Each enterprise will run unique workloads.\N每个企业都将运行独特的工作负载。
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.10,0:42:43.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, their infrastructure needs will also need to be unique and purpose-built as you can see from the screen here.\N因此，它们的基础设施需求也必须是独特的，并且如屏幕所示，量身定制。
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.16,0:42:46.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just look at the server in front of me.\N只需看看我面前的服务器。
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.56,0:42:47.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh this is whole\N这是一整套
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.50,0:42:48.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,series of\N合作
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.05,0:42:48.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,partnership\N关系
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.72,0:42:54.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,we\N我们
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.21,0:43:05.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,have.\N正在
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.20,0:43:10.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,Intel is working with uh lot of partners to provide servers,\N与众多合作伙伴合作，提供服务器，
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.70,0:43:18.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,Rex Scale solution designed to fit your existing infrastructure ready for AI\N瑞克斯规模解决方案专为适配您现有的基础设施并随时支持AI而设计
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.23,0:43:24.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,at scale as you can tell in front in front of you.\N规模化，正如你眼前所见。
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.08,0:43:27.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,We see token usage exploding.\N我们看到词元使用量呈爆炸式增长。
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.92,0:43:35.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Agent now consume 1,000 time more tokens than single event reasoning.\N当前智能体的词元消耗量是单次事件推理的1000倍。
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.76,0:43:39.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,In addition to building the best CPUs,\N除了打造最优秀的CPU，
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.72,0:43:50.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,it is critical that we deliver compute solution optimized for token consumption and token generation.\N我们必须提供针对词元消耗和词元生成优化的计算解决方案。
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.28,0:43:56.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,The bottom line, AI at scale will require heterogeneous computing.\N归根结底，规模化AI需要异构计算。
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.12,0:44:01.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,To this end, Intel recently announced a partnership with SambaNova.\N为此，英特尔最近宣布与SambaNova达成合作。
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.76,0:44:03.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,To talk more about this,\N有关更多细节，
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.54,0:44:07.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,let me call to the stage founder CEO of SambaNova,\N让我邀请SambaNova的创始人兼CEO，
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.80,0:44:16.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Rodrigo Leão.\N罗德里戈·莱昂上台。
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.04,0:44:19.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Rodrigo, welcome to joining me today.\N罗德里戈，欢迎今天来到台上。
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.56,0:44:20.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Lip-Bu.\N谢谢你，立武。
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.47,0:44:29.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,[clears throat] And over the next few months, we have announced few updates on our joint development partnership.\N[清了清嗓子] 接下来的几个月里，我们已宣布了关于双方联合开发合作的几项更新。
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.36,0:44:34.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Can we talk a little bit more about the work that Intel and SambaNova are doing together?\N我们能多聊聊英特尔和SambaNova合作开展的工作吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.04,0:44:36.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,Absolutely.\N当然。
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.15,0:44:37.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,We've been busy.\N我们一直很忙。
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.72,0:44:43.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Earlier this year, we announced a multi-year collaboration to deliver high-performance,\N今年早些时候，我们宣布了一项多年合作，旨在提供高性能的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.88,0:44:49.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,cost-efficient AI inference solutions based on Xeon infrastructure.\N基于至强基础设施的高性价比AI推理解决方案。
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.08,0:44:55.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,We've been building something really special, excited to show you today.\N我们一直在打造一些真正特别的东西，今天非常激动能向大家展示。
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.36,0:45:01.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the This is the SM50 SambaRack we announced earlier this year,\N这是我们今年早些时候宣布的 SM50 SambaRack，
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.55,0:45:10.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,rack-scale AI infrastructure built for a generative workloads.\N专为生成式工作负载打造的机架级AI基础设施。
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.00,0:45:20.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,It uses Intel Xeon 6 processors with SambaNova SM50 RDU's and shipping to customers later this year.\N它采用英特尔至强6处理器和SambaNova SM50 RDU，将于今年晚些时候交付客户。
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.20,0:45:25.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today, we're also excited to demonstrate the world's first heterogeneous,\N今天，我们还非常激动地展示全球首款异构
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.12,0:45:33.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,disaggregated inference using SambaNova's RDU with Intel's CPU and Nvidia GPUs.\N使用SambaNova的RDU搭配英特尔CPU和英伟达GPU实现解耦推理。
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.36,0:45:45.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,What you're about to see is the same prompt, the same model running side by side, two different stacks.\N你即将看到的是相同的提示和相同的模型并行运行，但使用了两种不同的硬件架构。
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.08,0:45:53.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, the one on the left is GPUs, RDUs, and CPUs disaggregated inference.\N左边这一边是 GPU、RDUs 和 CPU 分离式推理架构。
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.60,0:45:58.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this one on my right is GPUs on their own.\N而我右边这一边则是仅使用 GPU 的架构。
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.12,0:46:04.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,They both get the fed the same prompt and the same model just different stacks.\N两者接收相同的提示和相同的模型，只是硬件架构不同。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.40,0:46:07.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,The disaggregated inference stack is taking off.\N分离式推理架构正在迅速崛起。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.68,0:46:15.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,And what's happening here is you have the Xeon 6 processors doing all the tooling execution.\N这里，至强 6 处理器负责执行所有工具操作。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.20,0:46:20.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,You have Sambanova RDUs doing the decode and generating all of the tokens.\N而 Sambanova RDUs 负责解码并生成所有词元。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.45,0:46:29.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,And then you got the GPUs performing the prompt caching and the faster prefill reducing overall time.\NGPU 则负责提示缓存和更快的预填充，从而整体减少耗时。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.08,0:46:39.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,When all three chips are working together, you dramatically reduce the end-to-end latency and the agents for the fastest need for intelligent AI.\N当三类芯片协同工作时，端到端延迟显著降低，使智能 AI 代理实现最快响应。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.88,0:46:45.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,On the other side, the GPU stack is still working away.\N另一边，GPU 架构仍在持续运行。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.80,0:46:55.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, the initial results of our work is disaggregated inference is the and the GPUs, the RDUs, the CPUs, that's the fastest.\N因此，我们工作初期的结果表明，分离式推理架构，即 GPU、RDUs 和 CPU 的组合，是最快的。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.37,0:47:02.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,And artificial analysis in our test found to be two to three times faster than just the GPUs alone.\N我们的测试显示，人工分析表明其速度比仅使用 GPU 快两到三倍。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.32,0:47:06.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this gives us an early look at how fast this can be.\N这让我们提前看到了它的速度究竟有多快。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.40,0:47:07.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,Rodrigo.\N罗德里戈。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.10,0:47:15.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,The most exciting part about all this is that we have tremendous customer interest in these solutions.\N所有这些最令人兴奋的部分在于，客户对这些解决方案表现出极大的兴趣。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.20,0:47:15.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Absolutely.\N当然。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.80,0:47:17.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, let's see who comes next.\N那么，我们来看看下一位是谁。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.30,0:47:19.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, I'll be turning it back over to you.\N那么，我将把话筒交还给你。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.36,0:47:19.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.\N非常感谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.00,0:47:22.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\N谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.72,0:47:25.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\N谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.44,0:47:32.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,To continue this conversation, I'm delighted to invite my good friends uh you know,\N为了继续这个对话，我很高兴邀请我的好朋友，你知道的，
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.54,0:47:37.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Robert Smith uh is uh Vista Equity Partners chairman,\N罗伯特·史密斯，维斯塔股权投资合伙人公司的董事长，
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.04,0:47:40.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,CEO, and and uh you know,\N首席执行官，还有，你知道的，
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.95,0:47:51.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,the partners and uh Robert Smith to tell you more about how they plan to use these racks from Intel and Sambanova.\N合作伙伴和罗伯特·史密斯将为您详细介绍他们计划如何使用英特尔和Sambanova的机架。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.36,0:47:52.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Robert?\N罗伯特？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.44,0:47:53.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Great.\N太好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.89,0:47:56.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\N谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.16,0:47:57.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Lip-Bu, good to see you.\N立武，很高兴见到你。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.48,0:47:57.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,Same here.\N我也是。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.94,0:47:59.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for joining me.\N非常感谢你加入我。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.44,0:48:00.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Delighted.\N非常荣幸。
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.12,0:48:00.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, my friend.\N谢谢，我的朋友。
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.80,0:48:01.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, my friend.\N谢谢，我的朋友。
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.88,0:48:02.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes.\N是的。
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.72,0:48:14.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, Robert, AI is driving huge demand for computing and it's a reshaping the silicon system software and at all at once.\N所以，罗伯特，人工智能正在推动对计算的巨大需求，同时也在重塑硅基系统、软件以及所有这些领域。
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.34,0:48:19.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,What are you seeing and hearing from the enterprises that you work with?\N你与企业合作时，看到了什么、听到了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.32,0:48:24.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah, first of all, I'm excited to be here at Computex to join you at this wonderful event.\N是的，首先我很高兴能来到Computex，与你们共同参与这场精彩的盛会。
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.46,0:48:27.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um for us, it's been quite a quite a incredible.\N对我们而言，这简直令人难以置信。
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.70,0:48:33.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh there's been a huge focus right now to bring AI to enterprises around the globe.\N目前，我们正大力推动将AI引入全球各地的企业。
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.44,0:48:34.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh we want to make it usable.\N我们希望让AI变得可用。
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.76,0:48:37.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,We want to make it impactful for the organizations that we work with.\N我们希望让AI对我们的合作组织产生实际影响。
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.98,0:48:45.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know, we have over 90 portfolio companies and well over half of them have now uh have converted to Aigentic solutions.\N我们拥有超过90家投资组合公司，其中超过一半现已转向AI驱动的解决方案。
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.63,0:48:53.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,And with over 750 million users of our software, that really translates to over 10 billion agents.\N在我们软件超过7.5亿用户的基础上，这实际上相当于超过100亿个AI代理。
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.80,0:48:58.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's why we've launched DPU compute VC2 with our partners at Cambium\N正因如此，我们与Cambium Capital携手推出了DPU计算VC2。
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.46,0:49:06.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Capital to offer the world's first commercially available architecture for disaggregated inference.\N旨在提供全球首个商业化可用的解耦推理架构。
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.24,0:49:13.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,This novel Aigentic NeoCloud is built to deliver the fastest enterprise inference throughput of any architecture to date.\N这款创新的Aigentic NeoCloud架构专为实现迄今最快的企业级推理吞吐量而打造。
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.72,0:49:19.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,The demo you just witnessed with Rodrigo was conducted live in our Los Angeles data center.\N你们刚才看到的与罗德里戈共同演示的场景，是在我们洛杉矶数据中心现场完成的。
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.01,0:49:28.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have over 50 deployments planned in the US, which are targeted to convert existing data centers to inference data centers.\N我们计划在美国部署超过50个，目标是将现有数据中心转型为推理数据中心。
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.60,0:49:30.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is very exciting.\N这非常令人兴奋。
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.22,0:49:38.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,And as we saw from Rodrigo a few minutes ago, uh we are already starting to see strong momentum for these offerings.\N正如罗德里戈几分钟前展示的那样，我们已经看到这些产品开始展现出强劲的势头。
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.90,0:49:49.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Can you talk a little bit more about how Intel Victor call compute and our partners like SambaNova are bringing disaggregated uh inference to life?\N你能多谈一谈英特尔的Victor计算，以及像SambaNova这样的合作伙伴，是如何让分离式推理变为现实的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.88,0:49:54.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Of Of Uh I'm excited to share that First Together AI is the first commercial\N我很激动地宣布，First Together AI 是首个商用的 AI 工厂
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.08,0:50:01.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,customer and is excited to use this architecture as a service to accelerate inference workloads.\N客户非常期待将这一架构作为服务，用于加速推理工作负载。
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.20,0:50:07.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,We expect many of our enterprise software companies and their customers to quickly follow as the demand for\N我们预计，随着对AI工厂需求的上升，众多企业软件公司及其客户将迅速跟进。
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.64,0:50:12.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,inference keeps growing and this is has to be and it is more efficient than anything they previ-\N推理需求持续增长，这必须如此，而且比以往任何技术都更高效。
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.62,0:50:14.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,previously have had access to.\N此前从未有过访问权限。
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.96,0:50:23.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Most critically, VC2 is built and utilizes the SambaNova stack which is an air-cooled data center.\N最关键的是，VC2 基于 SambaNova 堆栈构建，并使用了风冷数据中心。
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.44,0:50:30.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,We believe it will deliver what enterprise customers and communities are asking for which is reliable,\N我们相信它将满足企业客户和社区所期待的可靠性能。
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.96,0:50:35.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,low latency, low cost inference at scale.\N低延迟、低成本的大规模推理。
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.72,0:50:40.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,Partnering to advance AI is one of the best ways to develop this transformational technology,\N与英伟达合作推进人工智能，是发展这一变革性技术的最佳方式之一，
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.59,0:50:47.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,making it usable and economically viable for enterprises worldwide.\N使该技术对全球企业而言既可用又具备经济可行性。
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.48,0:50:49.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh we are excited about that.\N嗯，我们对此感到非常兴奋。
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.34,0:50:53.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you for joining me today and I'm delighted to have you here.\N感谢您今天加入我的对话，很高兴您能在这里。
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.32,0:50:54.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,Always a pleasure, Lip-Bu.\N一直很高兴，立武。
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.23,0:50:54.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\N谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.60,0:50:55.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,Congratulations.\N恭喜。
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.91,0:50:57.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,14 more months.\N还有14个月。
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.14,0:50:58.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're excited to see what you're doing.\N我们很期待看到你们的进展。
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.96,0:51:00.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\N谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.84,0:51:02.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\N谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.72,0:51:10.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,As you just saw from Lorico and Robert, picking the right silicon architecture for your needs is critical.\N正如您刚刚从洛里科和罗伯特那里看到的，为您的需求选择合适的硅架构至关重要。
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.88,0:51:16.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,For enterprises today, there's a broad range of architectures to choose from.\N对于当今的企业而言，可供选择的架构范围非常广泛。
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.04,0:51:23.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,As large workloads increasingly become strategic asset for companies,\N随着大型工作负载日益成为公司的战略资产，
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.00,0:51:30.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,they are increasingly looking for silicon built around their exact needs.\N企业越来越希望采用针对自身具体需求定制的硅芯片。
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.68,0:51:33.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Next, I would like to invite Srini,\N接下来，我想邀请斯里尼，
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.44,0:51:43.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,a semiconductor design veteran and the leader of our purpose-built silicon team to talk more about the work we are doing in this area.\N一位资深的半导体设计专家，也是我们定制硅团队的负责人，来详细介绍我们在这一领域的进展。
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.88,0:51:52.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Srini.\N斯里尼。
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.56,0:51:53.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hi Libu, thank you.\N大家好，立武，谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.93,0:51:55.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.\N非常感谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.24,0:51:58.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,A very good afternoon to you guys.\N大家下午好。
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.12,0:52:00.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Purpose-built silicon it is.\N定制化硅芯片，就是它了。
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.16,0:52:05.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,This has been a journey that the industry industry has been using almost for the last decade or so.\N这是一段行业几乎已持续近十年的探索历程。
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.88,0:52:13.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,And especially the hyperscalers have tapped into this to its full potential and shown us the benefits in every way possible.\N尤其是超大规模厂商已将这一模式发挥到极致，并以各种方式向我们展示了其带来的种种优势。
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.52,0:52:17.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,Libu, last year you challenged us to say in this space,\N立武，去年你曾挑战我们，在这个领域里，
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.39,0:52:24.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,given the fantastic assets and the breadth of assets that we have at Intel, how could we be relevant to this?\N鉴于英特尔所拥有的丰富资产和广泛资源，我们该如何保持相关性？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.13,0:52:27.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not just be focused on the stuff that we do internally.\N而不仅仅局限于我们内部所做的事情。
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.14,0:52:30.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,How do we bring this out to the external world and do something more?\N我们如何将这些成果带出公司，对外产生更大影响？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.00,0:52:34.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,With that said, we we had a proposition.\N基于这一点，我们提出了一个设想。
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.14,0:52:36.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,We've been working on it.\N我们一直在为此努力。
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.08,0:52:40.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,And today, I'm very happy to share a couple of good outcomes that we have.\N今天，我很高兴能分享一些我们取得的积极成果。
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.92,0:52:43.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,The first on the hyperscaler side,\N在超大规模厂商方面，
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.20,0:52:46.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,we have Google and Intel our Google and Intel have gone into a\N我们与谷歌达成了合作，英特尔与谷歌携手推进，
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.00,0:52:52.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,partnership wherein Intel is delivering what is called as the infrastructure processing unit.\N英特尔正在交付一种被称为基础设施处理单元的产品。
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.83,0:52:55.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,I would call it Intel processing unit, actually.\N我实际上更愿意称之为英特尔处理单元。
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.52,0:53:02.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,But infrastructure processing unit, which is a a piece of silicon very vital for hyperscalers performance.\N但它的正式名称是基础设施处理单元，这是一种对超大规模厂商性能至关重要的硅基芯片。
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.52,0:53:04.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the journey journey continues.\N而旅程仍在继续。
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.14,0:53:11.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,And by the way, this is a deployment today, so it is not just something that we are doing, but it's already designed and being deployed.\N顺便说一下，这是今天部署的，所以这不仅仅是我们正在做的事情，而是已经设计完成并正在部署的。
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.12,0:53:18.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,While this is this is working on, we've been Intel as a company has been pretty active in the telco market.\N在此期间，作为一家公司，英特尔在电信市场非常活跃。
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.55,0:53:24.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,And in this telco market, another market customer, Ericsson, has been uh partnering with us.\N在这个电信市场，另一家客户爱立信一直与我们合作。
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.83,0:53:29.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,And Ericsson chooses us wherein we deliver our Intel delivers the next\N爱立信选择了我们，我们为他们提供下一代基础设施芯片，全球范围内全面部署。
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.08,0:53:34.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,generation infrastructure silicon for at a global scale for them across the board.\N这只是从最高层面快速预览一下专为特定用途设计的芯片领域正在开展的工作，
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.64,0:53:42.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,This just gives you a very sneak preview at the highest level to see the kind of work that's happening in the purpose-built silicon space,\N这是一个非常令人兴奋的领域，更重要的是，一个高增长领域。
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.58,0:53:47.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,which is a very exciting space, and more importantly a high-growth space.\N我刚想到，还有什么地方比台北的 Computex 更合适呢，
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.76,0:53:54.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I was just thinking, what better place than Computex on Taipei,\N这里定制芯片正是核心所在，
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.25,0:54:01.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,where custom silicon really is the name of the game here, to announce that Intel has officially entered this market.\N正好可以宣布英特尔正式进入这一市场。
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.25,0:54:08.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, looking forward to working with many of you guys, and see how we can be relevant to you some of your aspirational goals on silicon.\N期待与各位合作，看看我们如何在芯片领域助力你们实现一些雄心勃勃的目标。
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.81,0:54:09.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay?\N好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.40,0:54:09.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Lip-Bu.\N谢谢你，立武。
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.04,0:54:14.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm super excited about all these partnership that you announced, and more to come.\N我对你们宣布的这些合作感到非常兴奋，还有更多合作即将推出。
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.40,0:54:15.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes, absolutely more to come.\N是的，绝对还有更多合作即将推出。
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.84,0:54:16.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.\N非常感谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.64,0:54:20.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much, Lip-Bu.\N非常感谢你，立武。
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.19,0:54:21.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\N谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.64,0:54:27.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,The work Sweeny and the team are doing with purpose-built silicon is really important.\N斯温尼和团队在专用硅芯片方面的努力非常重要。
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.30,0:54:34.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm super excited to be partnering to build custom silicon with many leading-edge companies,\N我非常兴奋能与众多前沿企业合作，共同打造定制硅芯片，
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.68,0:54:40.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,as well as some of the most dynamic startups across the industry vertical.\N以及行业垂直领域中一些最具活力的初创公司。
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.88,0:54:46.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,I would like to highlight some of this partnership today.\N今天我想重点介绍一些这些合作。
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.92,0:54:54.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,One of the most exciting areas where we can deploy advanced silicon is biomedical engineering.\N我们可以部署先进硅芯片的最令人兴奋的领域之一是生物医学工程。
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.72,0:55:04.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,For years, emulating the function and functionality of the human brain has been the holy grail of computing.\N多年来，模拟人脑的功能和特性一直是计算领域的圣杯。
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.52,0:55:15.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,One company that is in the forefront of brain inspired computing is Echo Neurotechnologies.\N在脑启发计算领域处于前沿的一家公司是埃科神经科技。
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.28,0:55:22.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let us hear more from Eddie Chan, founder CEO of Echo Neurotechnology,\N让我们听听埃科神经科技创始人兼首席执行官陈奕德的分享，
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.96,0:55:28.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,and also one of the world's best neurosurgeons.\N他也是世界顶尖的神经外科医生之一。
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.40,0:55:29.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hi, I'm Eddie Chan.\N大家好，我是陈奕德。
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.51,0:55:34.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm a neurosurgeon at UCSF and co-founder of Echo Neurotechnologies.\N我是加州大学旧金山分校的神经外科医生，也是埃科神经科技的联合创始人。
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.88,0:55:42.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,For decades, AI has been brain-inspired, meaning borrowing ideas from neuroscience at a distance.\N数十年来，人工智能一直受到大脑启发，即远距离借鉴神经科学的思想。
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.64,0:55:45.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Neuromorphic computing has carried that vision the furthest.\N类脑计算将这一愿景推进到了最远。
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.94,0:55:53.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,It builds silicon around the brain's core principles like spike sparse communication, memory, and compute all in the same place.\N它围绕大脑的核心原理构建硅基芯片，例如脉冲稀疏通信、内存与计算在同一位置实现。
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.76,0:55:55.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,That architecture is right.\N这种架构是正确的。
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.43,0:56:02.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,But what's been missing is direct evidence of how the brain actually performs the computation.\N但一直缺少的是大脑实际执行计算的直接证据。
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.16,0:56:04.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's now within our reach.\N如今，这已触手可及。
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.36,0:56:14.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,For the first time, we can study how the human cortex computes language in real time at the resolution where computation actually happens.\N首次，我们可以以计算实际发生的分辨率，实时研究人类皮层如何处理语言。
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.08,0:56:16.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,This opens a whole new possibility.\N这打开了全新的可能性。
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.00,0:56:26.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Algorithms that are not just brain-inspired, but new ones that are trained on the brain activity itself, measured against the brain itself.\N这些算法不仅受大脑启发，更是直接基于大脑活动训练而成，与大脑本身进行对照。
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.80,0:56:30.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's the shift in our collaboration with Intel.\N这正是我们与英特尔合作的转变。
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.80,0:56:38.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Together, we're developing brain-trained algorithms for streaming speech that approach the efficiency of biological computation.\N我们正共同开发基于大脑训练的语音流算法，其效率接近生物计算。
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.96,0:56:41.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,The payoff runs both ways.\N这种合作带来的回报是双向的。
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.08,0:56:46.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,AI that's faster, lighter, and closer to how we actually think.\N更快、更轻量、更贴近我们真实思维方式的AI。
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.12,0:56:50.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,And new tools to restore speech to people who have lost it.\N以及用于帮助丧失语言能力者恢复言语的新工具。
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.24,0:56:57.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Together with Intel, we're building AI that learns from the most powerful computer ever discovered, the human brain.\N与英特尔携手，我们正在构建一种从人类大脑——迄今发现的最强大的计算机——中学习的AI。
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.88,0:56:59.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're excited about what's ahead.\N我们对前方的前景充满期待。
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.75,0:57:01.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\N谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.88,0:57:03.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Eddie.\N谢谢你，埃迪。
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.28,0:57:05.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm amazed by the work you are doing.\N我对你们所做的工作感到惊叹。
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.04,0:57:17.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm confident that our work together will help lay the foundation of highly efficient AI computers in the future.\N我相信，我们的合作将有助于为未来高效AI计算机奠定基础。
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.32,0:57:26.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Another company doing work at the cutting edge of biology is Greenstone Technologies.\N另一家在生物学前沿开展工作的公司是绿石科技。
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.40,0:57:31.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are partnering with Greenstone to establish scalable reference\N我们正与绿石科技合作，建立可扩展的参考架构，
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.24,0:57:39.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,architectures applicable across the broader life size imaging ecosystem.\N适用于更广泛的生物成像生态系统。
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.24,0:57:46.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dr. Joseph Wu is a head of cardiology at Stanford and the founder CEO of Greenstone.\N乔瑟夫·吴博士是斯坦福大学心脏病学主任，也是绿石生物科学公司的联合创始人兼首席执行官。
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.71,0:57:49.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's hear from him.\N让我们听听他的发言。
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.36,0:57:49.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hello,\N大家好，
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.77,0:57:53.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,my name's uh Joseph Wu and I'm a professor of medicine and director\N我叫乔瑟夫·吴，是医学教授，斯坦福心血管研究所主任，
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.30,0:57:58.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,of the Stanford Cardiovascular Institute as well as the co-founder of Greenstone Biosciences.\N也是绿石生物科学公司的联合创始人。
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.17,0:58:01.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for including me in Computex.\N非常感谢邀请我参加Computex。
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.85,0:58:07.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,Intel and Greenstone are working together to speed up the development of new medicines.\N英特尔与绿石科技正携手加速新药研发。
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.50,0:58:12.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our partnership combines state-of-the-art human genetics and biology from Greenstone with\N我们的合作结合了绿石科技最先进的基因组学和生物学技术，以及
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.00,0:58:18.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,advanced AI computing from Intel so that we can scale data processing,\N英特尔提供的先进AI计算，使我们能够扩展数据处理、存储和分析能力
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.41,0:58:20.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,storage, and analysis.\N绿石生物已建成全球最大的人类诱导多能干细胞生物银行
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.64,0:58:25.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,Greenstone has built the world's largest biobank of human-induced pluripotent stem cells.\N仅需10毫升血液，我们就能制造出与患者基因完全相同的脑、心脏、肝脏、肾脏、肠道
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.66,0:58:32.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,From just 10 cc's of your blood, we can make your brain, heart, liver, kidney, gut,\N以及您体内任何类型的类器官
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.12,0:58:37.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,and any type of organoids in your body that are genetically identical to the patient.\N这将使我们能够更快速、更低成本地测试现有和新型药物
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.92,0:58:44.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,This will then allow us to test existing and new medications more quickly and at a lower cost.\N我相信，人类生物学与AI计算的结合，将塑造未来十年生物医学的发展方向
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.87,0:58:53.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,I believe the combination of human biology and AI computing will help shape the future of biomedicines in the next decade.\N这正是我们对英特尔与绿石生物科学合作感到如此兴奋的原因
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.78,0:59:00.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this is why we're so excited about the partnership between Intel and Greenstone Biosciences.\N非常感谢，祝大家享受本次活动
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.28,0:59:02.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much and enjoy the event.\N谢谢大家
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.84,0:59:08.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Xie Xie Da Jia.\N谢谢大家
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.92,0:59:10.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Joe.\N谢谢你，乔
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.48,0:59:19.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm amazed by the work you are doing and I'm excited about the potential of our partnership.\N我对你们所从事的工作感到惊叹，也对我们的合作潜力充满期待
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.64,0:59:23.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Another key partners is Hitachi.\N另一个关键合作伙伴是日立。
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.96,0:59:30.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,They have a wide range of capabilities that help accelerating our our work,\N他们具备广泛的能力，有助于加速我们的工作，
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.02,0:59:36.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,our plan around foundry tools and quantum computing system.\N包括我们在代工工具和量子计算系统方面的计划。
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.48,0:59:42.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let us hear from Hitachi CEO Toku Naga-san.\N让我们听听日立首席执行官长野利行先生的发言。
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.00,0:59:44.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hello Computex.\N大家好，Computex。
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.30,0:59:47.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm Toshiaki Tokunaga, CEO of Hitachi.\N我是日立首席执行官德永俊明。
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.96,0:59:55.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,For decades, Hitachi and Intel have worked together to solve key challenges for society.\N数十年来，日立与英特尔一直携手合作，解决社会的关键挑战。
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.84,0:59:56.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,And today,\N而今天，
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.71,1:00:02.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,we are bringing our strength even closer by combining Intel's\N我们通过结合英特尔的先进计算能力与日立在物理世界中的工业实力，
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.53,1:00:08.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,advanced computing with Hitachi's industrial strength in the physical world.\N将双方优势更紧密地融合在一起。
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.84,1:00:16.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,We will create intelligent solutions that will benefit both businesses and society.\N我们将打造智能解决方案，惠及企业和整个社会。
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.92,1:00:18.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Lip-Bu.\N谢谢立武。
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.16,1:00:22.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,I look forward to our future together.\N我期待着我们未来的合作。
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.24,1:00:27.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, TT.\N谢谢你，立武。
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.40,1:00:32.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm really looking forward to working with you.\N嗯，我真的很期待与你合作。
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.68,1:00:42.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Finally, uh if you look at in uh we have the brains-inspired computing, biomedical medicine, and then energy.\N最后，如果我们看看，我们有类脑计算、生物医学，以及能源。
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.48,1:00:45.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,The last one is industrial automation.\N最后一个是工业自动化。
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.28,1:00:55.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,Finally, one partner I would like to hear like you to hear from is known for their pioneering work in industrial automation.\N最后，我想介绍的一位合作伙伴，大家可能都听说过，他们在工业自动化领域开创性的工作。
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.51,1:01:02.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let us hear from my very good friend uh Roland Busch at Siemens.\N让我们听听我的好朋友、西门子的罗兰·布施的发言。
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.08,1:01:03.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hi, Lip-Bu.\N你好，立武。
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.68,1:01:10.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,As a customer of Intel, we all know that global semiconductor demand has hit a high record.\N作为英特尔的客户，我们都知道全球半导体需求已创下历史新高。
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.64,1:01:15.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,In 2023, Siemens and Intel already joined forces to meet it.\N2023年，西门子和英特尔已经携手应对这一需求。
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.00,1:01:20.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,And now, we are taking our collaboration to the next level.\N现在，我们正将合作提升到新水平。
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.69,1:01:32.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are expanding our partnership across the entire value chain from design to manufacturing to chip applications in Siemens products.\N我们正在整个价值链上扩展合作，从设计到制造，再到西门子产品中的芯片应用。
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.40,1:01:40.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,We improve design quality through EDA automation and software solutions built with a genetic AI.\N我们通过基于遗传AI的EDA自动化和软件解决方案提升设计质量。
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.04,1:01:52.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,We partner on all areas of the manufacturing process including product lifecycle management automation electrification quality and sustainability.\N我们在制造流程的所有领域开展合作，包括产品生命周期管理自动化、电气化、质量与可持续性。
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.40,1:02:03.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,And what makes this even more relevant for us the chips created in this value chain will be used in our own Siemens products.\N而对我们而言，这一点更加重要的是，这条价值链中制造的芯片将用于西门子自身的产品。
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.24,1:02:07.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Looking forward to what's coming up.\N期待接下来的进展。
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.28,1:02:13.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Roland.\N谢谢，罗兰。
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.64,1:02:20.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are delighted to expand our long partnership with the Siemens groups.\N我们很高兴能拓展与西门子集团的长期合作关系。
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.12,1:02:27.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to disclose more about this partnership in the coming months.\N我期待在接下来的几个月里披露更多关于这一合作的信息。
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.32,1:02:37.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we are working with several other partners to keep pushing the boundary of what is possible.\N我们还与其他多家合作伙伴携手，持续推动可能的边界。
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.16,1:02:43.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,I would like to close by returning to where we start our conversation.\N我想以回到我们对话的起点来结束本次发言。
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.36,1:02:48.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,The opportunity for Intel and for our partners is immense.\N对英特尔以及我们的合作伙伴而言，机遇是巨大的。
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.88,1:02:58.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,PC edge a genetic physical AI data center and emerging intelligence center.\N个人电脑边缘、遗传物理AI、数据中心以及新兴智能中心。
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.48,1:03:06.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,From silicon to SOC to system and applications.\N从硅到系统级芯片，再到系统和应用。
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.64,1:03:11.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,This opportunity is only made possible by all of you.\N这个机会只有依靠在座各位才能实现。
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.76,1:03:13.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Look at the list.\N看看这份名单。
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.24,1:03:22.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the largest ecosystem of partners, suppliers, and customer.\N以及最大的合作伙伴、供应商和客户生态系统。
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.92,1:03:25.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Intel is an iconic company.\N英特尔是一家标志性公司。
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.88,1:03:30.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,We laid the foundation of modern-day computing.\N我们奠定了现代计算的基础。
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.16,1:03:33.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we are proud of our heritage.\N我们为自己的传承感到自豪。
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.64,1:03:38.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,But we do not want to rest on our honors and gloria.\N但我们不想躺在过去的荣誉和辉煌上。
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.04,1:03:43.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,A year ago, I joined as a CEO.\N一年前，我加入公司担任首席执行官。
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.48,1:03:49.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,I challenged my team to work with me to build a new Intel.\N我向我的团队发出挑战，要与我一起打造全新的英特尔。
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.80,1:03:52.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,That is exactly what we are doing.\N这正是我们正在做的事。
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.40,1:03:55.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are not encumbered by the past.\N我们不受过去束缚。
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.20,1:04:00.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are building something wonderful.\N我们正在创造一些了不起的东西。
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.20,1:04:04.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,It has been year of transformation for Intel.\N英特尔已经历了一年变革。
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.88,1:04:10.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,We ramp our 18A to high volume with multiple products.\N我们通过多款产品，将18A产能快速提升至高产量。
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.56,1:04:15.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are executing well on our advanced packaging milestones.\N我们在先进封装里程碑上执行得非常顺利。
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.96,1:04:22.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,We make tremendous progress on engaging customers and building our foundry business.\N我们在接触客户和建设代工业务方面取得了巨大进展。
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.56,1:04:27.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,We introduced new SOCs for all major compute\N我们推出了面向所有主要计算场景的新款系统级芯片。
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.92,1:04:36.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,platforms from premium mobile to high-density cloud and 5G.\N从高端移动平台到高密度云和5G平台。
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.92,1:04:43.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are rebuilding and strengthening partnership across the ecosystem.\N我们正在重建并加强整个生态系统中的合作。
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.20,1:04:54.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are double down on creating new business opportunity across existing and emerging domains.\N我们正加倍投入，在现有和新兴领域创造新的商业机遇。
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.36,1:05:04.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are working at the forefront to imagine reimagine computing and make it highly efficient for the AI era.\N我们正站在最前沿，重新构想计算方式，使其在人工智能时代更加高效。
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.04,1:05:07.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this is just the beginning.\N这还只是开始而已。
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.56,1:05:15.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm super excited to continue executing at hyper speed.\N我非常兴奋，能够以超高速持续推进。
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.76,1:05:23.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Before the lights go out, the race begins.\N灯灭之前，竞赛已然开始。
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.88,1:05:33.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,From simulation to strategy, performance begins with compute, with electrons that power pace, and data that backs decisions.\N从仿真到策略，性能始于计算，始于驱动速度的电子，以及支撑决策的数据。
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.40,1:05:34.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,The race never ends.\N竞争永无止境。
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.84,1:05:37.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Engineering never stops.\N工程创新永不停歇。
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.60,1:05:43.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Intel, official compute partner of McLaren Racing.\N英特尔，迈凯伦赛车官方计算合作伙伴。
